msgstr ""

#: src/dcc-gui.c:10646
msgid "Direct EC access"
msgstr ""

#: src/dcc-gui.c:10709
msgid "Switch on generic fan control?"
msgstr ""

#: src/dcc-gui.c:10711
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The fan daemon then sets the speed of the %s driver's fans through the "
"kernel's standard interface, following your fan profiles. Only fans whose "
"driver offers a manual mode are used.\n"
"\n"
"If the fan daemon stops, the fans run at 100%% until it starts again or the "
"laptop restarts. Switched off, the fans go back to the driver's automatic "
"mode."
msgstr ""

